---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Abin Biju" description="About Abin Biju">
  <h1 class="sr-only">About</h1>
  <div class="space-y-4 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
    <p>
      I'm Abin Biju, a final-year Computer Science student and software developer. I like software
      engineering, especially backends and systems programming. When I'm not messing with agents and
      code, I like writing and reading fiction, mostly fantasy and classics.
    </p>
    <p>
      I've worked across backend, frontend, and AI in varying capacities.
    </p>
    <p>
      You may be interested in my curated RSS{' '}
      <a href="https://my-rss-reader.pages.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline underline-offset-2">collection</a>,
      which is also available as an{' '}
      <a href="https://github.com/SerAbin1/rss-reader/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline underline-offset-2">Android app</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Or, if you want to track location, you may like my{' '}
      <a href="https://crates.io/crates/gt06" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline underline-offset-2">gt06</a>{' '}
      library. Or mayhaps you're in Kerala, in which case you can just use{' '}
      <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.evide.evide_ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline underline-offset-2">Evide</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Or, are you a parent concerned about your child's phone usage? Let{' '}
      <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.seraphguardlabs.guardienai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline underline-offset-2">GuardianAI</a>{' '}
      take care of it.
    </p>
    <p>
      Or, are you at Pondicherry University and feeling hungry? Let{' '}
      <a href="https://pumato.online" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline underline-offset-2">Pumato</a>{' '}
      take care of that.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
